# xLaDe Security Advisories

This directory contains public security advisories for xLaDe.

We introduce a `DCVE` (Decentralised Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) identifier.
Format - 'DCVE-yyyy-0000-project'

---

## Advisories

| DCVEs                                            | Identified By | Resolved By       | Summary                                                                                    |
|--------------------------------------------------|---------------|-------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| [DCVE-2026-0001-xLaDe](DCVE-2026-0001-xLaDe.txt) | Codex         | Lakshit and Codex | A feature-branch push could replace SourceForge `main`.                                    |
| [DCVE-2026-0002-xLaDe](DCVE-2026-0002-xLaDe.txt) | Codex         | Lakshit and Codex | Mirror credentials could be used by same-repository feature-branch workflows.              |
| [DCVE-2026-0003-xLaDe](DCVE-2026-0003-xLaDe.txt) | Codex         | Lakshit and Codex | Kernel protection could pass when its baseline was unavailable and miss submodule changes. |

---

## Publishing

We publish DCVEs in both GitHub and our official site.

